    src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09d24b8e-a1da-48e2-9992-6045138c6653"
    />
    
    After the optimization, build_attn_metadata() takes an average of 9.8
    ms, a performance improvement of about 53.8%. At 4 concurrent requests
    with an input token count of 50k and an output token count of 350, the
    average output token throughput is 83.8 tok/s, an improvement of about
    11.7%.
    
